SUMMARY:Breakfast: Protein overnight oats
DESCRIPTION:About 420 kcal and 37 g protein.\n\n- ½ cup rolled oats\n- 1 s
 coop whey protein\n- ¾ cup 1% milk\n- 1 tsp chia seeds\n- ½ medium banan
 a\, sliced\n\nStir the oats\, protein powder\, milk and chia together in a
  jar. Refrigerate overnight. Top with the banana.\n\nLog it in Fuel after 
 you eat.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Breakfast: Protein overnight oats
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
