SUMMARY:Lunch: Turkey and hummus wrap with yogurt
DESCRIPTION:About 500 kcal and 47 g protein.\n\n- 1 whole-wheat tortilla (8
  inch)\n- 4 oz deli turkey breast\n- 3 tbsp hummus\n- a handful of lettuce
 \n- a few tomato slices\n- a few cucumber slices\n- ¾ cup nonfat plain Gr
 eek yogurt\n- ⅔ cup strawberries\n\nSpread the hummus on the tortilla\, 
 layer on the turkey and vegetables\, and roll up. Yogurt and berries on th
 e side.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
