SUMMARY:Dinner: Sheet-pan lemon chicken with potatoes and green beans
DESCRIPTION:About 575 kcal and 48 g protein.\n\n- 6½ oz chicken breast (ra
 w weight)\n- 9 oz baby potatoes\, halved\n- 1½ cups green beans\n- 1 tbsp
  olive oil\n\nToss everything with the oil\, lemon\, garlic\, salt and pep
 per. Roast at 425°F: potatoes alone for 15 minutes\, then add the chicken
  and beans for 20 more.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
