 t\, sliced\n- 2½ cups chopped romaine\n- ½ small cucumber\, chopped\n- 1
  small tomato\, chopped\n- 1 oz crumbled feta (3 tbsp)\n- ⅓ cup chickpea
 s\, rinsed\n- 2 tsp olive oil\n\nToss everything with the oil\, a squeeze 
 of lemon\, oregano\, salt and pepper.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
