SUMMARY:Dinner: Turkey tacos
DESCRIPTION:About 605 kcal and 43 g protein.\n\n- 3 corn tortillas (6 inch)
 \n- 5 oz 93% lean ground turkey (raw weight)\n- 2 tsp taco seasoning\n- 1 
 cup shredded lettuce\n- ½ tomato\, diced\n- 3 tbsp salsa\n- 3 tbsp reduce
 d-fat shredded cheese\n- ¼ small avocado\, diced\n- ⅓ cup black beans\,
  on the side\n\nBrown the turkey with the seasoning and a splash of water.
  Warm the tortillas and build the tacos.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
