 d\n- 1 can (5 oz) tuna in water\, drained\n- 1 tbsp light mayonnaise\n- 2 
 tbsp nonfat plain Greek yogurt\n- 10 baby carrots\n- 1 string cheese\n- 1 
 medium apple\n\nMix the tuna with the mayonnaise\, yogurt\, pepper and a l
 ittle mustard\, and make the sandwich. Carrots\, cheese and apple on the s
 ide.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
