 ve oil\n- 1 slice whole-wheat toast\n- ⅔ cup strawberries\n\nSoften the 
 pepper in the oil\, wilt the spinach\, then scramble in the eggs and white
 s. Serve with the toast and berries.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
