DESCRIPTION:About 485 kcal and 41 g protein.\n\n- 5 oz 93% lean ground turk
 ey (raw weight)\n- ⅔ cup kidney or black beans\, rinsed\n- ⅔ cup canne
 d diced tomatoes\n- ⅓ onion\, diced\n- ⅓ bell pepper\, diced\n- 1 tsp 
 olive oil\n- 3 tbsp reduced-fat shredded cheese\n\nBrown the turkey with t
 he onion and pepper in the oil. Add the tomatoes\, beans\, chili powder an
 d cumin\, and simmer 20 minutes. Top with the cheese. Cook four portions a
 t once\; it reheats well.\n\nLog it in Fuel after you eat.
